    "note": [
        {
            "structuredValue": [],
            "parallelValue": [],
            "groupedValue": [],
            "value": "ARviz is reinventing the automotive experience and user interface by driving advancements in wireless and augmented reality technologies that enhance the driver and passenger experience.  ARviz will allow users to experience automobiles and driving in a unique way by not just providing them with the things they want, but also the information and support they need. The augmented reality windshield combined with wireless technologies is allowing ARviz to recreate the youthful joy and fun of driving while providing a unique experience that is visually engaging.",
